    "title": "Eldership events",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Events that happen under an Eldership Succession ."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Displeased events",
            "level": 2,
            "content": []
        },
        {
            "heading": "Pleased events",
            "level": 2,
            "content": []
        },
        {
            "heading": "Elder feels lonely",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Elder is not ruler, not married, has no lover and ruler is not on demand cooldown.\nComplying grants +35 Opinion ( Fufilled Elder demand ) with concerned Elder for 10 years, and +10 Opinion ( Elders pleased ) with other Elders for 10 years.\nPlaces a 5 year cooldown on Elder demands."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "A: Spend time with them.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Gain Elder Care modifier (-3 Stewardship, +0.5 Piety) for 5 years."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "B: Give spouse.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "A courtier becomes spouse of Elder. Courtier is not ruler, is adult, not married, not concubine, not consort, not incapable, not ill, less than 35 years old, preferably attractive."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "C: Send a present.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Give 6 months of income (min 5, max 100)."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "D: Do not comply.",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "-35 Opinion with concerned Elder ( Refused Elder demand ) for 10 years. -10 Opinion with Elders ( Elders displeased ) for 10 years."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Grant county request to good unlanded dynasty member",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Elder is Pleased or Ecstatic . Places a 20 year cooldown on Elder demands."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Elder choice of title recipient is affected by Elder traits:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "The Elder themself , requires Stubborn more likely if Proud , less if Humble , Elder lose Humble",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Smart pick , more likely if Kind , less if Envious not rival of Elder, not dumb, not weak, not evil, is smart or attractive",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Beloved pick , more likely if Gregarious , less if Shy , Elder has +20 Opinion of character or is married to title recipient",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Competent pick , more likely if Diligent , less if Slothful , has at least 8 in one of Diplomacy, Intrigue, Stewardship or Learning",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Complying grants +35 Opinion ( Fufilled Elder demand ) with concerned Elder for 30 years, and +10 Opinion ( Elders pleased ) with other Elders for 10 years."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Refusing causes -35 Opinion with concerned Elder ( Refused Elder demand ) for 30 years, -10 Opinion with Elders ( Elders displeased ) for 10 years."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Ecstatic events",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Elder must be at least 40 years old, not incapable and not imprisoned."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Elder praise",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Ecstatic Elder praises ruler."
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "To increase likelihood:",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Elder age above 50 and 60",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Elder Diplomacy and/or Learning of 8, increases every 2 points up to 20",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Elder Prestige, increases at 100, 250, 500, 750, 1000",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Elder is Stubborn",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Ruler gains Prestige and the Elder Praise modifier (+10 Tribal Opinion, +.2 monthly Prestige) scaling on Elder Learning."
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "If the event triggers again, the modifier is replaced by the new one."
                },
